## Evidence boundary

This PR proves a specific existence result in the normalized standard-circular ribbon family. It does not claim:

- a classification of the complete two-surface intersection locus;
- stability under arbitrary three-dimensional perturbations;
- a linking number, Hopf link, or ambient-isotopy class;
- a simultaneous seven-band embedding satisfying all twelve dyads;
- an electron ontology or Pauli-exclusion derivation;
